Run layered Strap command and tool tests.

Usage:
  strap test [--list] [--only text] [--layer commands-0|commands-1|commands-2|tools] [--with-paid-providers]

Tests live under tests/commands-0, tests/commands-1, tests/commands-2, and tests/tools.
ChatGPT-backed tests run by default. Non-ChatGPT paid provider tests must explicitly opt in with --with-paid-providers.
